WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:00.500
Mr.

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.436
Santos's constituents go to Washington.

00:00:03.470 --> 00:00:05.538
Dozens of residents from embattled

00:00:05.538 --> 00:00:07.674
Republican Congressman George Santos's

00:00:07.674 --> 00:00:08.341
New York

00:00:08.341 --> 00:00:10.276
district have taken a bus

00:00:10.276 --> 00:00:11.478
to the nation's capitol

00:00:11.478 --> 00:00:13.546
to demand that he resign

00:00:15.982 --> 00:00:17.751
I took off from work to come

00:00:17.751 --> 00:00:19.285
to a personal day.

00:00:19.285 --> 00:00:21.688
So go to Washington and ask

00:00:21.721 --> 00:00:23.023
become a party to hold Mr.

00:00:23.023 --> 00:00:24.591
Santos accountable.

00:00:24.591 --> 00:00:26.292
It is pretty embarrassing.

00:00:26.292 --> 00:00:30.030
The daily barrage of just

00:00:30.030 --> 00:00:30.997
these lies.

00:00:30.997 --> 00:00:33.366
I mean, who is representing us?

00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:34.200
I feel like

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:35.035
this is a

00:00:35.035 --> 00:00:37.637
some kind of storybook character

00:00:38.104 --> 00:00:40.974
that that's scamming us and laughing

00:00:41.174 --> 00:00:42.509
because we're being scammed.

00:00:42.509 --> 00:00:44.611
I happen to be a Republican

00:00:44.611 --> 00:00:45.412
and that's why

00:00:45.412 --> 00:00:46.513
I'm really disappointed

00:00:46.513 --> 00:00:48.882
in the Republicans, especially because

00:00:50.850 --> 00:00:52.952
it stands by this guy literally

00:00:52.952 --> 00:00:54.821
and figuratively.

00:00:55.221 --> 00:00:57.190
Let's bring in CNN's David McKenzie.

00:00:57.190 --> 00:00:58.391
How is Congressman

00:00:58.391 --> 00:01:00.360
Santos responding to this?

00:01:00.360 --> 00:01:00.960
Yeah, so, Jake,

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:02.562
I was up there where you are today

00:01:02.562 --> 00:01:03.296
with the residents

00:01:03.296 --> 00:01:04.931
as they were trying to get some answers

00:01:04.931 --> 00:01:06.599
from Congressman Santos.

00:01:06.599 --> 00:01:07.033
He wouldn't

00:01:07.033 --> 00:01:08.568
come out and speak with them, though.

00:01:08.568 --> 00:01:09.069
It seemed like

00:01:09.069 --> 00:01:10.937
he was in his office at the time

00:01:10.937 --> 00:01:12.172
earlier today.

00:01:12.172 --> 00:01:13.039
He suggested

00:01:13.039 --> 00:01:13.506
he would,

00:01:13.506 --> 00:01:14.774
but he later told CNN

00:01:14.774 --> 00:01:16.943
he would correspond with them in writing

00:01:16.943 --> 00:01:17.610
and sort of seem

00:01:17.610 --> 00:01:18.878
to make light of the number

00:01:18.878 --> 00:01:20.980
of signatures on the petition

00:01:20.980 --> 00:01:22.715
that they delivered to his office.

00:01:22.715 --> 00:01:23.349
Take a listen.

00:01:26.186 --> 00:01:27.587
I look forward to welcoming them

00:01:27.587 --> 00:01:28.888
and having a thoughtful discussion

00:01:28.888 --> 00:01:29.222
with them.

00:01:29.222 --> 00:01:30.090
At what point does

00:01:30.090 --> 00:01:31.891
this become a distraction, of course,

00:01:31.891 --> 00:01:33.126
and why would I not talk to them?

00:01:33.126 --> 00:01:34.594
That's their freedom of speech, right?

00:01:34.594 --> 00:01:35.395
Now, entertain

00:01:35.395 --> 00:01:36.296
a conversation with them

00:01:36.296 --> 00:01:37.163
every single day.

00:01:37.163 --> 00:01:39.599
I represent them all equally.

00:01:39.599 --> 00:01:40.800
And there were really a wide

00:01:40.800 --> 00:01:42.635
range of folks up on the Hill today.

00:01:42.635 --> 00:01:43.536
I met one woman

00:01:43.536 --> 00:01:44.637
and she told me she works

00:01:44.637 --> 00:01:46.573
with Afghan refugees

00:01:46.573 --> 00:01:48.842
and has a lot of sensitive information

00:01:48.842 --> 00:01:49.909
about their whereabouts

00:01:49.909 --> 00:01:51.111
and would not feel comfortable

00:01:51.111 --> 00:01:53.713
working with Congressman Santos's office.

00:01:53.713 --> 00:01:55.849
Another constituent, a Republican,

00:01:55.849 --> 00:01:57.383
telling me he's proud of the gains

00:01:57.383 --> 00:01:59.185
Republicans have made in recent years

00:01:59.185 --> 00:02:00.086
in New York

00:02:00.086 --> 00:02:02.222
and that Santos really compromises that.

00:02:02.222 --> 00:02:03.990
And that was just universal

00:02:03.990 --> 00:02:05.558
frustration, Jake, with House

00:02:05.558 --> 00:02:07.460
Speaker Kevin McCarthy

00:02:07.460 --> 00:02:08.962
and a real sense of disbelief

00:02:08.962 --> 00:02:09.662
among some

00:02:09.662 --> 00:02:10.730
that this can happen,

00:02:10.730 --> 00:02:12.765
that there are so few mechanisms

00:02:12.765 --> 00:02:13.566
really available

00:02:13.566 --> 00:02:15.101
to remove a sitting member,

00:02:15.101 --> 00:02:17.537
no matter how egregious the lie.

00:02:17.537 --> 00:02:20.006
Yeah, I mean, the list of lies that Jorge

00:02:20.006 --> 00:02:21.541
Santos told to get elected

00:02:21.541 --> 00:02:23.543
is too long to go through here.

00:02:23.543 --> 00:02:24.244
But it's

00:02:24.410 --> 00:02:26.779
practically everything on his resumé.

00:02:27.046 --> 00:02:29.182
One of the most egregious

00:02:29.182 --> 00:02:30.850
is that his mother died

00:02:30.850 --> 00:02:33.086
because she was at the World Trade Center

00:02:33.086 --> 00:02:34.621
during the nine 11 attacks.

00:02:34.621 --> 00:02:35.555
It's not true,

00:02:35.555 --> 00:02:38.191
but he's made that claim many times.

00:02:38.191 --> 00:02:39.859
And amazingly,

00:02:39.859 --> 00:02:40.593
his guest

00:02:40.593 --> 00:02:42.962
tonight is going to be a firefighter

00:02:42.962 --> 00:02:45.965
who actually was at the World

00:02:45.965 --> 00:02:48.334
Trade Center on Nine 11. Is that right?

00:02:48.701 --> 00:02:49.002
Yeah.

00:02:49.002 --> 00:02:50.470
Santos has long suggested

00:02:50.470 --> 00:02:51.337
that his mother died

00:02:51.337 --> 00:02:52.972
of the residual impact

00:02:52.972 --> 00:02:55.742
of caught up in the cloud of nine 11.

00:02:55.742 --> 00:02:58.545
And what we found was that immigration

00:02:58.545 --> 00:02:59.078
records show

00:02:59.078 --> 00:02:59.646
that she wasn't

00:02:59.646 --> 00:03:01.848
even in the country at the time.

00:03:01.848 --> 00:03:02.882
That firefighter

00:03:02.882 --> 00:03:03.383
though, Jake

00:03:03.383 --> 00:03:04.417
Michael Weinstock

00:03:04.417 --> 00:03:06.853
evidently thinks that the issue of nine

00:03:06.853 --> 00:03:08.421
11 first responders receiving

00:03:08.421 --> 00:03:10.590
adequate medical care is worth.

00:03:10.590 --> 00:03:12.625
The association with Santos

00:03:12.926 --> 00:03:14.661
but it's coming at a price for him.

00:03:14.661 --> 00:03:16.863
He lost his job at a law firm

00:03:16.863 --> 00:03:17.997
as a result

00:03:17.997 --> 00:03:21.034
of agreeing to be Santos's guest.

00:03:21.634 --> 00:03:23.269
Oh wow. All right.

00:03:23.269 --> 00:03:24.470
Eva McCann, thanks so much.

00:03:24.470 --> 00:03:25.038
Appreciate it.

